  "source": {
    "title": "Gilford Town Commissioners minute book, 1915-1951, meeting of 30 January 1920: \"The following Members were duly Elected\" (PRONI LA/77/2/BA/1; Keep note \"LA/77/2/BA/1 (partial)\", photo #2, counting from 0)",
